  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ffda2812f8a1e7d8c63ed93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会变成\r\n超级有名的小真。\r\n这种程度的换装易如反掌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f821409b7a3d787daea15fb63a33166c0806b950fd98d2514d681bab707bf2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:befedfd58e3e5ee7398f3bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伏特加看到这身打扮后说\r\n我看起来很聪明……\r\n……小真，本来就很聪明哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d429de2a406a33b61530468500c0555a630616a07ecd00387172d303b599f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe6a955cd61c09bd5d8aeef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。\r\n下次要和赤骥换什么样的衣服呢？\r\n就选一件蓬蓬又可爱的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e54941607b08b4831e3fffed79e53c229b92b697f8e368ffe9981c311b640d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bbba7570101dd8039c4dd68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还算可以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a972165abbef3b9ea56ac9236fb73275dd9c70536d542071b3d09f63a899a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2fe3b8c01e23ea014676465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵，我赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc55d1350dc9410fb10932c49e70b464b3edc784db12c297b8ca630eee56e828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6beff3c6fec3a1e7f43534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……输掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b82a05b3e4ac50cdf500abe7a02126d7e2f95d476c1d7adb42772a2b76737d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ba7562ff6bc748e8ad1dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还算可以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a972165abbef3b9ea56ac9236fb73275dd9c70536d542071b3d09f63a899a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ff2a5ae579252604c31cac3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像创下新纪录了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06b028124d59ad946921d496af1aecf57f36c0a5500d8d2eda64e0ac62d6259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c1721d78fcdce0703c8fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来大家都到齐了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72851e94c3f899ed022c2d4757cf5498bac92a8c408510eddeed0fe09b52603b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8261bfa0e71969b139b461a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05427ca39c53d181f06a8059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么样的训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d683c2016cdbb6ead380765a447cedcf8919ae8260b236c63d83f84b48d32442",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006cf558d44506ce029f2e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这间学园的历史中，\r\n小真目前算是什么等级的存在呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "652e546f3f29451089fb9e4d22f9aa721b2854ded8bc24b3b82483a657971d68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e016081aa7af51e2ec0233b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要去报名参赛吗？\r\n那小真也陪你一起去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09fc2db458fb86e2680bd57502cd26f67e4c407f05dd2627548f0975f9df6c2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441aca1a9bd2748855590a43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的主角是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "725ac3ac5264ffa9986c4927a747edaa2a454459a6024ad21619533c1cb2bcd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d48eda9aad70b6158adf44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤骥，觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7945bd6af64d58cdbcacd1d3f3a4add15ca456295d3370f2d263de19193fbc2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8c4d061316028f3efd19cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1ae0d1cb418d2306ce5d6bec9f2c08989ef74351a2e13992c83d97f47b02e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cac32f98a2af3b5af4d668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔……力量不断涌现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "004d4d3031690ab5db39c57ff79d8f325186add6e16556f1ad603aef3929c5cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365f7024e3cac3f0ab2b8f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0a080ee1c086451de387185f1b5ddbd724d39dd6ee8ee7c1ce898aff54e19f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f312aa6a42a4823718f18b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里有好多娃娃喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c38835e818429f1bcc9e8ada63ef81b31813a6df21b0cf231d358a212664f59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2e515eebced22a91ca810f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d451f46b33a02f60d5453e3ae20916e2eb376a38136de5b6217d57d44af927d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc0e0125206916a289c6b61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d33fa799759f6546538572",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～太厉害了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4abd51071df1e10d0e1da6bfecfca8af3e5fb081d6a85fb4ad639db9655818e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af3a76d7d2f9edbe632d6a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟预想的一样夹到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd52a3b18be150c72eacd3021ac3de237fbf62a26d23ae31a6b22f5f32b8408e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a324ec9c8ed444bf3184517c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没夹到，但玩得很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d72dcc541b10949f8618cb7fb8b5a8a83bea98337d417e4826f33251e03ad8d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6b84dd6ccb9c9e56e47ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～太厉害了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4abd51071df1e10d0e1da6bfecfca8af3e5fb081d6a85fb4ad639db9655818e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2fe3fbdfdc7008d72f827d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟预想的一样夹到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd52a3b18be150c72eacd3021ac3de237fbf62a26d23ae31a6b22f5f32b8408e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9348b28da16c31c994c58ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0dad597dc82a31dd69060476ba8d5a0bc081bd7005ed6641f89ca6ade33857a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f98813caf96a3809dce4e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3163a85625154dff7fc1166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e815780f86376af6e6ffe7369d814224d8fbbf6fc39cb8f756048e15eb564ada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ceea24a5212c385cdd846db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c25bfcd056a0531207fa6992712226d909de04cc2864e7e18a75c96fadcf862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e6ad674d45bea513e484bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大丰收呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e82e2deeabac39f301645ec96e51ff4625e026d7e729f3fc2fa05c97955c7e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c578427f180169637bc7c3f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔……夹到好多……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e778f1e559b89c53771401a1c660fe3a56bc7b96dd35a3edb46601e981ac73a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41f9a712aeedce3b642a4f82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b186032526287797ebc3f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3704eb10fed276b2180b17f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你正在沉思吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd9accba0dd065dc1711258a79b9fe8e8dca02632c2beec625c8bce2a5dc11d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb62ab08779c6e40dc56aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Ouch。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d136b2d3266d9b55f59f0003c9865cd593ea3d6983fd80c15e6b0177376e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d6ba3b731b142bfebf16a1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d0eeceded72eace8823cc24b753a0a3007c8ea0e0a4fc8073e9cf559b5eb03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4e544e1da3e21e30ab8a18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "敬请期待下次的奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcae55c8ad1c9234938e1384e3b86e5cb14011b03067555475fce6ef82bd9274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99bef97b62668be2b961cff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这个症状是……脚的疲劳还没\r\n恢复……如果继续跑下去一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf7b5b8bad0a5c9378199360634090e388fdfdb792b9b12d9816964b50c23a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b13c127ddf6246dacee3db6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真警报启动！\r\n小真已经陷入「疲惫」。\r\n听懂了吗？是「疲惫」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "383d07ccad2e8171ce4bf2b89a9697e7ea367465693448893408c39cce2de129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a889bfd5bbde13d9f002787f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，快让我接受训练吧。\r\n我会把所有训练\r\n一个一个解决给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4c2dc910420140eb86c38c70d115390f1b37f2855b704e894bcd67552d4f4b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb5a3fd8f7f5f4562a2a428d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识一下，\r\n小真比昨天更加进步的实力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f43645f1946a0af1165202ec594c5e4e9fb8033626cb3142c985f3c98cbded3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc9afea64738aba729ce5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真越是进行训练，\r\n就会变得越有魅力喔。\r\n接下来要做什么训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89eb4182f0d6ba0eeb654b4e89990deab43bc02b12b21f9b0342feafea8b5d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a3d4c892f75a7a9725fd44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员想的小真专用训练内容，\r\n让我有点期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9514d4c4d3f20c1c89530176e32af4132519fb959627af6ffb3888dbce1fa5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ecd60e50e46bd00904acced",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦好啦，训练的时间到了。\r\n我这边也准备好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab2a205a84e2b9f1aed319f4db77403ac047908ac38612a06e133d3c30ccec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e867aeb0809cebefe3c1bcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要在比赛中表现活跃，\r\n就能提升被当成吉祥物喜爱的机率。\r\n加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c9c659a8b0f4079e330c91f7149895b98191122e053f821432c4ce50b52f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab7ed0a1c911aa91a9cc722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……专心、专心。\r\n…………唔──",
      "source_fingerprint": "422af6497beaa278121d08668b22bcf34d7ceb6794c33fea4bda43271a8594ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8902888feaae7675126d8603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起出门吗？\r\n光是靠唐突的邀约，\r\n可是无法打动少女心的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7518eff5f6b7304acde0369e97a2ebb5c8d0a581223b9532575561ac315aede8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c47ca7f70e03733170b4e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…………？咦？\r\n嗯嗯？刚才有一瞬间，\r\n世界上的时间好像消失了似的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f8271f013207ad50f812f4e4ebb19d8784c1f713d3d6c9cc6e4d56a54a4934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18e30f7c524ee309d9594ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，身体好沉重……\r\n明明有好好睡午觉，\r\n却还是这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee9e614fe42d168c2a32e16ca7311879eed70ee6282ceb002d9e7146a8c9457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbee5605ad66445ec61c264b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，又要参赛吗？\r\n如果不偶尔做些不一样的事情，\r\n粉丝们也会腻吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fa2f82ae821ff54310553a364d47e78d79da283063f85709388fa61f47184d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1940c945d1d43a50a60e4c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真的还要再参赛吗？\r\n……真的吗？\r\n……真～的～吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a15f9716df369d35929adc86284dec17b554e1b73b83d1d714b9591e9f17c034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b251ca1fb3c2a12f07243624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘周边制造商们，请看好了。\r\n小真将会证明自己是个\r\n值得推销的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "684543b47bb794e16917992af6ab60a7b0c48a7f4e0b6713af7be3e01e025574",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a359c93412b50e82c622bfc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～观众络绎不绝……！\r\n这些人都将成为小真的粉丝……\r\n唔呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbcabe8ec5e37c53d2130463a94689324985cb57126208cbc9220b31c4f02eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d36dc1da8d5b773b73e97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以移开视线喔。\r\n因为接下来的每个场面\r\n都会是小真的精彩瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1442e9ac8bf7d5f37a49b3bb61078cd2b36465167e091e4286a02417fede6be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe494ec435fa935e313629a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真昨天梦到\r\n自己拿下了第一名，\r\n所以有信心能够获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d13318e4309ef2c219248d949b857fd61d733081e05b2b1c8f40a55d2bc36d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5879213f9d019a150236d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁，\r\n只要拿下第一名，\r\n大家自然都会关注小真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6bde1fc6b5aebdacc26bad85683a268605d318b258142d051fe349ea9b8c25a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6cbcd8c55c56cd650ba849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下小真平日\r\n一点一滴累积的成果吧。\r\n强壮的小真要上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5580e9551290fac01e7a61edf66a7c6b918de1ee3553f3c39d517204196c76f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2319708a1783eb2fe9583205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等比赛结束后，我会挥手。\r\n你看见后要用力双手抱胸，\r\n并露出笑容喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f01cf479320e1011eea8b6d1a7f2d371630f67a29743e67b6153ecb36c8c19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a427752532f32fa838831d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……集中……好了。\r\n我把力量都集中在心窝了。\r\n等进入最后直线再一口气爆发出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6ae908cec57ada6b142b6e1325c266caf92387c84a3daa34d2a7da416237d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd147491a001fff711ffe42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论付出了多少努力，\r\n只要没有留下好成绩，\r\n就无法获得别人的关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b748660c4d311432595b5f7332250eb9b0c810c691d834996a6d2ddb184047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887528aa1ae69c7e75fa9a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便状态调整得并不完美，\r\n但也已经走到这一步了。\r\n……我要为今天的奔跑留下意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43496780d09178243d11018f6fe95ce6c1e22f23eba3562e2d54566e930ce4ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9d684b1cdb5c6814fbc441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以在休息室检查蹄铁吗？\r\n虽然应该没问题……\r\n但我想再检查一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "902a30922bbf14a21a005639481200ab96cf38d47f78453d0096983225276fe7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24e35919a5234914bb488de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我心里还是会有不安。\r\n但这不代表我可以在这里落败。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f53a323d450ff3e550c0fd63e1dc2b67d6fa71215a5077a275fa975805b34f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee919b71a23f51497c263fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……心脏跳得好快，真是碍事。\r\n冷静下来吧，一定没问题的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf84016f9080b59062de4f330625ff09c8a7a71ae4c577e8b655e480a16eb5ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f01233c246274de8a1ab12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会竭尽全力，直到最后一刻。\r\n……我不想就这样、被埋没。",
      "source_fingerprint": "618adc31235593e022f27fe2a777e429feb427fbf3b93d1b30d425489135a865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905ab4a52a8cfdfc609b915f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难受时才更要站稳脚步。\r\n这是关键的一战。\r\n只要撑过去就会有商机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2f37a32788353eac269b4360b7883fc6b9bbc917b6754e8f455f34a2cb9bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170af68d151f6c98178c973b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～",
      "source_fingerprint": "055afe339cd4865e65ab35abd460bf34d7042d1791d77a932832ea2d4f7e30bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ab7aa6ef3469a19449ded69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efb765eaf4a4e1d07520fce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3451ba14efa6c424c039a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来念书吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a8ab96367f1fecd8a5597a31d41e49058a905ae254b66853db9c081ae88db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d9a1c591effd3da23a283e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b17a27301cdc7902f682194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86da1b53b8e9030921223d1116840eec3ad77bbe410b4f3802da0abd63a8d247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe8863d1701f00cd26d269c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382de79e5af87cfa84fea453698c0c59f570bac174669c44123c53cce6f366b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69539829490edf894a2f9a57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，是大海……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f264985c2db982e72c4077c46e7dc57047b700dec1756517127b77c9d5fb65ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97714f324704a67dde814426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得留下了美好的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b1ed91bf8b9fd0e47d8593bda3a938c7c56cde182112eb687c13bdaf1ba1d09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db69b4a6170af3aa78340b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948250f012f32942f63b6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮手小真登场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece2e686b5ec3c4a914c99658ff232de8b8334c78da9fa3d3e5f000937b7fe20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2204643352da3428b3d5f947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a54c3e0a4c22fa18eec40b86616d9118dd4aacb049d8ce94a1df739a4dfd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805ae8094bb808a441c92417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来大家都到齐了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72851e94c3f899ed022c2d4757cf5498bac92a8c408510eddeed0fe09b52603b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2031"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
